    "detailed_description": "Join Operation Space Force, a free-to-play team-based shooter that takes place in space. <br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387280/extras/184edf4527a97fcce5be9454a9e5d220.avif?t=1708569992\" /></span><br>With 6+ unique characters on the roster, experiment with their speed and power. Select the one who shall deem you victorious in the arena. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387280/extras/8225ce9215bddcc269403c067d26a08b.avif?t=1708569992\" /></span><br>There are four slots: Two to choose from between 13+ guns, one to select from 2+ grenades, and one for a knife. Weapon customization allows you to change certain parts of the gun and offers a variety of skins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387280/extras/69a5d9b4b67d7b2a1b7568d7789d7d28.avif?t=1708569992\" /></span><br>Roam in 4+ different maps, where two maps will stay the same, while three maps will change every time a new match is loaded. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387280/extras/7adb18bba17ca9bb01915fad1fce65f8.avif?t=1708569992\" /></span><br>Join a team and play up to 5+ game modes. Host a game, have the freedom to decide the gameplay, and create. Joining a game is perfectly optional as well.",
